    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, you mentioned US-7720-C. I actually had my intern take a quick look at that one and they seemed a bit worried that the \"pulse-modulated coolant flow\" part sounds almost identical to our core claim. \n\nCan you dig a little deeper into that specific patent? I want to be 100% certain we aren't walking into a rejection or a lawsuit. If there's even a slight overlap in the mechanism, I need to know now before we spend the money.",
