      "content": "Honestly, the risk is a manageable 3 out of 10, provided we frame the claims correctly. If I were the examiner, I would attempt to invalidate the claim by focusing narrowly on the *physical hardware* described in US-7720-C, trying to force a comparison based solely on the \"pulse\" action. However, our documentation clearly shows PulseCore integrates a proprietary feedback loop that makes the modulation fundamentally different from their static control system.",
